re></div><h3 id=\"依赖变更管理\">依赖变更管理</h3><p>外部 API 变更是自动化失效的首要原因。建立变更感知机制：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"#!/bin/bash&#10;# 每周检查关键 API 的版本/状态&#10;declare -A APIs=(&#10;  [&quot;github&quot;]=&quot;https://api.github.com&quot;&#10;  [&quot;notion&quot;]=&quot;https://api.notion.com/v1/users/me&quot;&#10;  [&quot;slack&quot;]=&quot;https://slack.com/api/api.test&quot;&#10;)&#10;&#10;for name in &quot;${!APIs[@]}&quot;; do&#10;  status=$(curl -s -o /dev/null -w &quot;%{http_code}&quot; &quot;${APIs[$name]}&quot;)&#10;  if [ &quot;$status&quot; != &quot;200&quot; ] &amp;&amp; [ &quot;$status&quot; != &quot;401&quot; ]; then&#10;    echo &quot;WARNING: $name API returned $status&quot;&#10;    # 发送告警&#10;  fi&#10;done\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#!/bin/bash</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 每周检查关键 API 的版本/状态</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">declare</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -A</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> APIs</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  [</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">\"github\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://api.github.com\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  [</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">\"notion\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://api.notion.com/v1/users/me\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  [</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">\"slack\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://slack.com/api/api.test\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> name </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"${</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">APIs</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">[</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">]}\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">do</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">curl</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -s</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -o</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /dev/null</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -w</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"%{http_code}\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">APIs</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">[</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$name</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">]}\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [ </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$status</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> !=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"200\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ] &#x26;&#x26; [ </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$status</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> !=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"401\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ]; </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">then</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"WARNING: </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$name</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> API returned </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$status</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 发送告警</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  fi</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">done</span></span></code></pre></div><p>同时关注：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>订阅 API 提供商的 changelog/blog（如 GitHub Blog、Notion Updates）</li>\n<li>设置 API 版本号检查（如 <code>Notion-Version</code> header）</li>\n<li>n8n/Zapier 的更新日志（集成可能在平台升级时 break）</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"定期维护清单\">定期维护清单</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"markdown\" data-code=\"## 月度自动化维护（每月第一个周末）&#10;&#10;### 检查项&#10;&#10;- [ ] 查看所有 n8n workflow 的最近执行状态&#10;- [ ] 检查 Hazel 规则是否仍在正常匹配&#10;- [ ] 验证 Hammerspoon 所有 watcher 是否活跃&#10;- [ ] 确认 launchd 定时任务正常执行（查看日志）&#10;- [ ] 检查文本扩展是否有过时内容需要更新&#10;&#10;### 更新项&#10;&#10;- [ ] 更新 n8n 到最新版本：docker compose pull &amp;&amp; docker compose up -d&#10;- [ ] 检查 Raycast 扩展是否有更新&#10;- [ ] 更新 Homebrew 依赖：brew update &amp;&amp; brew upgrade&#10;- [ ] 备份所有自动化配置到 Git&#10;&#10;### 清理项&#10;&#10;- [ ] 清理超过 30 天的自动化日志&#10;- [ ] 归档不再使用的 Workflow（Disable 而非删除）&#10;- [ ] 检查磁盘空间（自动化可能产生累积数据）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## 月度自动化维护（每月第一个周末）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">### 检查项</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [ ] 查看所有 n8n workflow 的最近执行状态</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [ ] 检查 Hazel 规则是否仍在正常匹配</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [ ] 验证 Hammerspoon 所有 watcher 是否活跃</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [ ] 确认 launchd 定时任务正常执行（查看日志）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [ ] 检查文本扩展是否有过时内容需要更新</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">### 更新项</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [ ] 更新 n8n 到最新版本：docker compose pull &#x26;&#x26; docker compose up -d</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [ ] 检查 Raycast 扩展是否有更新</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [ ] 更新 Homebrew 依赖：brew update &#x26;&#x26; brew upgrade</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [ ] 备份所有自动化配置到 Git</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">### 清理项</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [ ] 清理超过 30 天的自动化日志</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [ ] 归档不再使用的 Workflow（Disable 而非删除）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [ ] 检查磁盘空间（自动化可能产生累积数据）</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"最佳实践\">最佳实践</h2><h3 id=\"可观测性三支柱\">可观测性三支柱</h3><ol>\n<li><strong>日志（Logs）</strong>：每个自动化任务产生结构化日志</li>\n<li><strong>指标（Metrics）</strong>：执行次数、成功率、耗时趋势</li>\n<li><strong>追踪（Traces）</strong>：跨系统流程中每个步骤的状态</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"版本管理策略\">版本管理策略</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 自动化配置的 Git 管理&#10;~/.automation/&#10;├── n8n-workflows/     # 导出的 JSON workflow 文件&#10;├── hammerspoon/       # Lua 配置&#10;├── hazel-rules/       # 规则导出&#10;├── scripts/           # Shell/Python 脚本&#10;├── launchd/           # plist 文件&#10;└── CHANGELOG.md       # 变更日志&#10;&#10;# 每次修改自动化配置后&#10;cd ~/.automation&#10;git add -A&#10;git commit -m &quot;update: [component] description of change&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 自动化配置的 Git 管理</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">~</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">/.automation/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">├──</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> n8n-workflows/</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">     # 导出的 JSON workflow 文件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">├──</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> hammerspoon/</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">       # Lua 配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">├──</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> hazel-rules/</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">       # 规则导出</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">├──</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> scripts/</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">           # Shell/Python 脚本</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">├──</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> launchd/</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">           # plist 文件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">└──</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> CHANGELOG.md</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">       # 变更日志</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 每次修改自动化配置后</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cd</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ~/.automation</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -A</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> commit</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -m</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"update: [component] description of change\"</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"测试策略\">测试策略</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>冒烟测试</strong>：每个自动化有一个&quot;dry run&quot;模式验证基本流程</li>\n<li><strong>金丝雀部署</strong>：新版本先在非关键任务上验证</li>\n<li><strong>混沌测试</strong>：偶尔手动断开网络/停止服务，验证降级是否工作</li>\n<li><strong>回归测试</strong>：更新工具版本后，检查所有自动化是否仍正常</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"文档化要求\">文档化要求</h3><p>每个自动化流程应有一个简短文档：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"markdown\" data-code=\"## 流程名称：[name]&#10;&#10;- **目的**：一句话说明这个自动化解决什么问题&#10;- **触发**：什么情况下会执行&#10;- **依赖**：依赖哪些外部服务/API&#10;- **输出**：执行后产生什么结果&#10;- **失败影响**：如果失败会怎样&#10;- **手动替代**：如果自动化不可用，手动怎么做&#10;- **最后验证**：YYYY-MM-DD 最后确认正常工作\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## 流程名称：[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-light-text-decoration:underline;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF;--shiki-dark-text-decoration:underline\">name</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\"> **目的**</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">：一句话说明这个自动化解决什么问题</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\"> **触发**</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">：什么情况下会执行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\"> **依赖**</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">：依赖哪些外部服务/API</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\"> **输出**</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">：执行后产生什么结果</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\"> **失败影响**</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">：如果失败会怎样</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\"> **手动替代**</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">：如果自动化不可用，手动怎么做</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\"> **最后验证**</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">：YYYY-MM-DD 最后确认正常工作</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"工具与生态\">工具与生态</h2><h3 id=\"监控与告警工具\">监控与告警工具</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>免费额度</th>\n<th>适合</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Healthchecks.io</td>\n<td>心跳监控</td>\n<td>20 个检查</td>\n<td>Cron 任务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>UptimeRobot</td>\n<td>端点监控</td>\n<td>50 个监控</td>\n<td>Web 服务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Betterstack</td>\n<td>日志+告警</td>\n<td>免费层</td>\n<td>综合监控</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ntfy.sh</td>\n<td>推送通知</td>\n<td>完全免费</td>\n<td>告警通知</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"备份方案\">备份方案</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对象</th>\n<th>备份方式</th>\n<th>频率</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>n8n Workflows</td>\n<td>JSON 导出 + Git</td>\n<td>每次修改</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>n8n Credentials</td>\n<td>加密备份 (pg_dump)</td>\n<td>每日</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Hammerspoon 配置</td>\n<td>Git (dotfiles)</td>\n<td>每次修改</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Hazel 规则</td>\n<td>应用导出</td>\n<td>每月</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>launchd plist</td>\n<td>Git (dotfiles)</td>\n<td>每次修改</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"总结\">总结</h2><p>维护与可靠性决定了一个自动化系统是&quot;长期资产&quot;还是&quot;短期玩具&quot;。建立正确的运维习惯：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>每个自动化都需要监控——不被监控的自动化终将静默失败</li>\n<li>心跳模式是最简单有效的健康检查方案</li>\n<li>优雅降级比完美运行更重要——允许在部分失败时继续提供价值</li>\n<li>月度维护清单是防止自动化债务累积的关键纪律</li>\n<li>所有配置纳入 Git——这是唯一的灾难恢复手段</li>\n<li>文档化每个自动化的手动替代方案——当一切都失效时，你需要 Plan B</li>\n</ol>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"维护与可靠性","id":"维护与可靠性"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"自动化失败分类学","id":"自动化失败分类学"},{"level":3,"text":"可靠性等级","id":"可靠性等级"},{"level":3,"text":"故障恢复策略","id":"故障恢复策略"},{"level":2,"text":"实战指南","id":"实战指南"},{"level":3,"text":"监控系统搭建","id":"监控系统搭建"},{"level":4,"text":"方案 1：轻量级（个人用）","id":"方案-1-轻量级-个人用"},{"level":4,"text":"方案 2：Heartbeat 模式","id":"方案-2-heartbeat-模式"},{"level":4,"text":"方案 3：日志集中管理","id":"方案-3-日志集中管理"},{"level":3,"text":"优雅降级设计","id":"优雅降级设计"},{"level":3,"text":"依赖变更管理","id":"依赖变更管理"},{"level":3,"text":"定期维护清单","id":"定期维护清单"},{"level":2,"text":"最佳实践","id":"最佳实践"},{"level":3,"text":"可观测性三支柱","id":"可观测性三支柱"},{"level":3,"text":"版本管理策略","id":"版本管理策略"},{"level":3,"text":"测试策略","id":"测试策略"},{"level":3,"text":"文档化要求","id":"文档化要求"},{"level":2,"text":"工具与生态","id":"工具与生态"},{"level":3,"text":"监控与告警工具","id":"监控与告警工具"},{"level":3,"text":"备份方案","id":"备份方案"},{"level":2,"text":"总结","id":"总结"}],"prev":{"title":"自动化阶梯模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/personal-automation/automation-philosophy/automation-ladder-model"},"next":null}